---
import { url } from '../lib/url';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="mt-auto bg-[#111] text-[#888] text-sm">
  <div class="border-b border-[#333] px-4 md:px-10 py-6 flex flex-wrap gap-4 md:gap-6">
    <a href={url()} class="text-[#ccc] font-semibold hover:text-white transition-colors">홈</a>
    <a href={url('about/')} class="text-[#ccc] font-semibold hover:text-white transition-colors">위원회 소개</a>
    <a href={url('registration/')} class="text-[#ccc] font-semibold hover:text-white transition-colors">민원·신고</a>
    <a href={url('notices/')} class="text-[#ccc] font-semibold hover:text-white transition-colors">알림·소식</a>
    <a href={url('intranet/login/')} class="text-[#666] hover:text-[#ccc] transition-colors ml-auto text-xs">
      직원용 내부망
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="px-4 md:px-10 py-8">
    <p class="text-[#ccc] font-bold text-base mb-3">이능관리위원회</p>
    <p class="mb-1"><span class="inline-block mr-4">(03000) 서울특별시 ○○구 ○○로 1</span></p>
    <p class="mb-1">
      <span class="inline-block mr-4">민원 상담 1551-0000 (가상)</span>
      <span class="inline-block">평일 09:00 – 18:00</span>
    </p>
    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-[#666] mt-4">© {year} 이능관리위원회. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</footer>
